      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=IN022"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early mail for Indianola arrived by horseback from the post office located in the town of Canadian.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
